<p>You might want to consider a different writing assistance tool, possibly Grammarly. Readers will notice pretty quickly things like this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5913 is a humanoid entity dressed up in a bartender suit of the 1920s, which consisted of wearing a white shirt, a black or red tie, black trousers, and black shoes, subject measures 6 to 14 feet tall has a general appearance as a tall black figure that has no human facial features of any kind; it shows very little muscle mass, arms are out of proportion with the rest of the body, the subject has shown to have no signs of hair, eyes, nose, its mouth can open up to two (2) times the norm of a normal human, and has normal-looking bare hands, albeit with fingers longer and bonier than a typical human approximately 1.5 meters each.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is <em>one sentence</em>. Run-ons as long as this aren't going to be entertaining to read or pleasant to parse.</p>

