<p><strong>Seeking Greenlight:</strong> Yes!</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article.</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> My SCP idea is an entity that takes a form of a soldier (pretty much a U.S Soldier).</p>
<ul>
<li>Has a unique form that make him invulnerable to most damage (mainly being bullets, his form weakens by any sort of explosives)</li>
<li>Has weapons that are connected to him and cannot be removed (if someone attempts to, the soldier gets irritated and even aggressive)</li>
<li>The soldier entity gets PTSD an effect that resembles PTSD, while in this state, he goes berserk, destroying everything he sees in a fit of rage.</li>
<li>Can communicate with humans in mainly English</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Central Narrative</strong>: This SCP is an unknown entity that takes the form of a soldier. No one knows exactly what the entity is or why it's taking the form of a soldier, but theories are that the entity was released from an unknown containment in an anonymous operation led by the U.S Government. This SCP is an excellent hand-to-hand fighter, shooter, and uses military strategies. This SCP is also known to be relatively peaceful (as it is a soldier), but can be violent if angered, or in the state of his PTSD effect. The U.S Government insists that they know nothing of the soldier, but some scientists think they are lying. SCP officials think that the soldier was once a leader of the squad with how he talks and uses his strategies of moving through buildings/locations and how secretive he is in interviews. The form of this SCP is unknown to SCP officials as it's an unusual substance and can make the wearer immune to most damage. This SCP is known to get out of containment easily when angered by officials or D-Class, but seems blind when in it's PTSD effect.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabbers:</strong> I find this idea for an SCP to be unique because you don't see a lot of humanoid SCPs with actual guns. I find that what's best about SCPs is the mystery around them; like where they come from and what the goals of the SCPs are. This idea has a bit of mystery of who the soldier is, what the form substance could be, and I will probably add more mysteries to this SCP if I am able to write about it.</p>
<p>The overall concepts that I think makes this idea unique: An SCP who uses modern day weapons to dispatch enemies, the mystery of this SCP, and that it's a soldier SCP.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> NONE.</p>

